      "act": "NEXT STEPS",
      "role_note": "what to do next",
      "narration_text": "Your move: for any classifier you deploy across demographic groups, compute base rates per group on the real population. Run this script. Check which fairness criteria your model satisfies and which it violates by necessity. Document the choice. You cannot avoid the trade-off — you can only be honest about which side you are on.",
